 "blocksHtml": "<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/02a70399e0ae.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image914\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image7416aaa77ee2ac3d\" src=\"/media/18fbdb593d62.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-5/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nUsing 3D visual metaphors to showcase the Superlist product enabled us to say a lot by showing a little\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-4/12@sm offset-1/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nCreating excitement and intrigue for the release of Superlist without revealing any specific product features posed an interesting challenge. Our solution was to create bespoke 3D graphics to visualise the core concepts that were then embedded in the site using WebGL, tied to the users scroll position to create a fun and immersive experiences.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image9896aaa77ee37c95\" src=\"/media/b4f865ed2d76.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/d711f1649e79.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image977\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<div class=\"relative js-video-wrapper\">\n<video class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-video\" crossorigin=\"\" data-cursor=\"video\" data-src=\"/media/71175c9c01bc.mp4\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n<button class=\"btn btn--circle d-flex mute-btn js-mute mute-btn--video\" data-audio-enter=\"audio.hover\" data-cursor=\"hide\">\n<span class=\"sr\">Toggle Sound</span>\n<div class=\"btn__bg mute-btn__bg absolute d-block js-mute-bg\"></div>\n<svg class=\"btn__icon mute-btn__icon absolute fill js-mute-icon\" enable-background=\"new 0 0 18 16\" id=\"Layer_1\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 16\" x=\"0px\" xml:space=\"preserve\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" y=\"0px\">\n<line class=\"mute-btn__icon-line js-sound-line\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"16\"></line>\n<line class=\"mute-btn__icon-line js-sound-line\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"13\" x2=\"13\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"16\"></line>\n<line class=\"mute-btn__icon-line js-sound-line\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"5\" x2=\"5\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"16\"></line>\n<line class=\"mute-btn__icon-line js-sound-line\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"16\"></line>\n<line class=\"mute-btn__icon-line js-sound-line\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"9\" x2=\"9\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"16\"></line>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"btn__inner mute-btn__inner absolute\">\n<span class=\"btn__inner-bg mute-btn__fill absolute fill js-mute-fill\"></span>\n</div>\n</button>\n<div class=\"absolute bottom left pointer-events-none js-mobile-video-progress\" style=\"width: 2.7rem; height: 2.7rem; bottom: -0.8rem; left: 5rem;\">\n<span class=\"video-indicator video-indicator--video absolute fill\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 100 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<circle class=\"video-indicator__outer js-cursor-video-outer\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"49\"></circle>\n<g class=\"\">\n<path class=\"js-video-play\" d=\"M58,49.1c0.7,0.4,0.7,1.3,0,1.7l-14.2,8.2c-0.7,0.4-1.5-0.1-1.5-0.9V41.8c0-0.8,0.8-1.3,1.5-0.9L58,49.1z\" fill=\"#040404\"></path>\n<g class=\"js-video-pause\">\n<path d=\"M47.1,38.5h-4.2c-0.7,0-1.2,0.6-1.2,1.2v17.5c0,0.7,0.6,1.2,1.2,1.2h4.2c0.7,0,1.2-0.6,1.2-1.2V39.7\nC48.3,39.1,47.8,38.5,47.1,38.5z\"></path>\n<path d=\"M57.1,38.5h-4.2c-0.7,0-1.2,0.6-1.2,1.2v17.5c0,0.7,0.6,1.2,1.2,1.2h4.2c0.7,0,1.2-0.6,1.2-1.2V39.7\nC58.3,39.1,57.8,38.5,57.1,38.5z\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-4/12@sm offset-1/12@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nAll in the details\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<br/>\nFrom WebGL 3D buttons complete with sound effects to letter by letter text animations; every detail was carefully considered to provide an extra layer of delight to the interactions that tied in with the fun and friendly Superlist brand feel.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-4/12@sm offset-1/12@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/23898f14cd6d.m4v\" dom2webgl=\"image982\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image9416aaa77ee40bea\" src=\"/media/b0d35e34978d.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-5/12@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nUnder the hood; technologies and optimisation\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nMatching great creative ideas with equally innovative development techniques is at the heart of our process. The mixture of 3D assets and front-end animations required some outside-of-the-box thinking to ensure optimum performance and load times.<br/>\n<br/>\nFor example, we created a custom tool in Houdini that enabled us to remove any faces in the 3D models that weren’t visible; resulting in a much smaller file size and cleaner geometry. Combined with baked-in animations and lightweight matcap texture files, the result is a highly performant scroll experience.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<a class=\"btn btn--regular btn--fill btn--light js-btn\" data-btn=\"fill\" data-cursor=\"hide\" href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<span class=\"btn__inner js-btn-inner\">\n<span class=\"btn__content js-btn-content\">\n<span class=\"d-flex flex-row items-end\">\n<span class=\"btn__text\">\nRead our technical case study\n</span>\n<svg class=\"btn__icon d-inline-block js-btn-icon\">\n<use href=\"#arrow\"></use>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-6/12@sm offset-1/12@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/29cf162ea3d1.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image993\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/4082206ee71c.m4v\" dom2webgl=\"image980\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container d-flex@sm items-center justify-center mb-5 mb-20@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm mb-6 mb-0@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: 30, rotationZ: 3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '30%' : 0 }, rotationY: 10, rotationZ: -3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/d5153fd3fc36.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: -30, rotationZ: -3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '-10%' : 0 }, rotationY: -10, rotationZ: 3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/69ac3d7a078e.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm | js-awards\">\n<div class=\"container my-5 d-block d-flex@sm my-10@md overflow-hidden\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-2/5@sm pr-0 pr-3@sm relative\">\n<h2 class=\"t-lh-1.1\">\n<span class=\"pl-0.25 t-serif t-italic t-500 t-2 t-3@sm\">Awards &amp; <br/></span>\n<span class=\"t-sans t-500 t-2 t-3@sm\">Recognition</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"award-trophy absolute fill w-1/1 h-1/1\" dom2webgl=\"c:Awards\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-3/5@sm pt-1 pt-5@sm user-select-none\">\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"awwwards\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>Awwwards</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nSite Of The Day<br/>\nSite Of The Month\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"css\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>CSSDA</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nSite Of The Day\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"fwa\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>FWA</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nSite Of The Day\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"lovie\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>Lovies</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nGold Winner, Best Homepage\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"generic\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>Davey</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nGold Winner, Best Homepage<br/>\nGold Winner, Best Use of Animation<br/>\nGold Winner, Best Homepage\n</p>\n</div